@startuml
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    ActorBorderColor #334155
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

title Диаграмма последовательности: Авторизация и загрузка билета в защищенное хранилище (Задание 4)

actor "Слушатель (Артём)" as User
participant "Mobile Client\n(React Native)" as Mobile
participant "Локальное хранилище\n(SecureStore)" as LocalStore
participant "API Gateway\n(FastAPI)" as API
participant "Auth & Ticket\nService" as CoreService
database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB

User -> Mobile: Запуск приложения / Вход (Email, Пароль)
activate Mobile

Mobile -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
activate API
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> API: UserRecord + PasswordHash
deactivate DB

API -> API: Верификация bcrypt hash
API --> Mobile: 200 OK + JWT Access/Refresh Tokens
deactivate API

Mobile -> LocalStore: Сохранение JWT токенов
activate LocalStore
LocalStore --> Mobile: OK
deactivate LocalStore

Mobile -> API: GET /api/v1/tickets/my-tickets\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
activate API
API -> CoreService: FetchActiveTickets(user_id)
activate CoreService
CoreService -> DB: SELECT * FROM tickets WHERE user_id = ? AND status = 'ISSUED'
activate DB
DB --> CoreService: List<TicketEntities>
deactivate DB

CoreService -> CoreService: Генерация HMAC подписей билетов
CoreService --> API: List<TicketDTO>
deactivate CoreService

API --> Mobile: 200 OK [JSON с билетами и токенами]
deactivate API

Mobile -> LocalStore: Атомарная запись билетов в оффлайн-кеш
activate LocalStore
LocalStore --> Mobile: Кеш сохранен
deactivate LocalStore

Mobile --> User: Отображение билета с активным QR-кодом\n(Режим готовности к офлайн-проходу)
deactivate Mobile

@enduml
